<title>THAILAND: Cogeneration to issue debentures.</title>
<headline>Cogeneration to issue debentures.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thai power firm Cogeneration will issue convertible debentures worth up to 3.2 billion baht, or foreign currency equivalent, it said in a filing to the Stock Exchange of Thailand.</p>
</text>
